+	 * exists; GStreamer's va decoders create theirs that way and allocate
+	 * surfaces on demand afterwards. With no surface there is no format and
+	 * no buffer yet, and STREAMON on an empty queue is refused, so such a
+	 * context starts streaming at its first BeginPicture instead. Render
+	 * targets given here still require the format to be in place.
+	 */
 	video_format = driver_data->video_format;
-	if (video_format == NULL)
