+	 * Whether this context's queues are streaming. A context created before
+	 * any surface exists (GStreamer's va elements do this, with no render
+	 * targets) cannot start them: the formats are set and the buffers made
+	 * when the surfaces are created. It streams at its first BeginPicture.
